	<key>NSAppleMusicUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto's stereo shows the song playing in Music, with play, pause and next. Titles are read only when you open music controls.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Meow Merch connects to a LOOI desktop robot over Bluetooth LE.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Meow Merch connects to a LOOI desktop robot over Bluetooth LE.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto reads or adds calendar events only when you ask.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto reads or adds calendar events only when you ask.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto uses the camera for visual-awareness features, such as attention cues for the avatar.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto connects to model servers and a LOOI desktop robot on your local network when you configure a LAN endpoint.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Toto uses your approximate location to show the local weather. You can type a city instead.</string>
